<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:id="KR3c0005-en-4439b8c5" type="transl"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>Han Feizi and the Art of Statecraft in Early China</title><editor role="translator">Christoph Harbsmeier</editor></titleStmt><publicationStmt><ab>published electronically as part of the TLS project at https://hxwd.org</ab><availability status="2"><ab>This work has been licensed for use in the TLS</ab></availability></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title>Han Feizi and the Art of Statecraft in Early China</title>Leiden: Brill, 2025</bibl><ab>Translation of <bibl corresp="#KR3c0005"><title xml:lang="och">韓非子</title></bibl> into <lang xml:lang="en">English</lang>.</ab></sourceDesc></fileDesc><profileDesc><creation resp="#CH">Initially created: <date>2026-09-24T17:58:44.02+09:00</date> by CH</creation></profileDesc></teiHeader><text><body><div><head>Translated parts</head><p xml:id="KR3c0005-start"><seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_001-1a.3-h" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#wilke" modified="2026-10-21T22:23:02.321+09:00">Chapter 1: First Audience in Qin</seg><seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_001-1a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#wilke" modified="2026-10-21T21:53:11.956+09:00">I, your subject, have heard:</seg><seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_001-1a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#wilke" modified="2026-10-21T21:53:25.208+09:00">to speak about a matter that you do not understand</seg><seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_001-1a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#wilke" modified="2026-10-21T21:53:29.574+09:00">is unwise;</seg><seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_001-1a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#wilke" modified="2026-10-21T21:53:40.584+09:00">not to speak about a matter that you do understand</seg><seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_001-1a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#wilke" modified="2026-10-21T21:53:44.485+09:00">is disloyal.</seg><seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_001-1a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#wilke" modified="2026-10-21T21:53:51.137+09:00">When ministers are disloyal,</seg><seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_001-1a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#wilke" modified="2026-10-21T21:53:58.389+09:00">they deserve death;</seg><seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_001-1a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#wilke" modified="2026-10-21T21:54:05.859+09:00">when they make proposals but are in error,</seg><seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_001-1a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#wilke" modified="2026-10-21T21:54:12.822+09:00">they likewise deserve death.</seg><seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_001-2a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#wilke" modified="2026-10-21T21:54:18.445+09:00">Even so,</seg><seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_001-2a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#wilke" modified="2026-10-21T21:54:39.247+09:00">I wish to speak up on what I have heard, without withholding anything -</seg><seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_001-2a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#wilke" modified="2026-10-21T21:54:53.928+09:00">may Your Majesty determine my crime!</seg><seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_001-3a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#wilke" modified="2026-10-21T21:59:40.677+09:00">I have heard:</seg><seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_001-3a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#wilke" modified="2026-10-21T21:59:59.435+09:00">All the world, from Yan in the north to Wei in the south,</seg><seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_001-3a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#wilke" modified="2026-10-21T22:00:20.142+09:00">have linked up with Jing (Chu), bolstered their relations with Qi,</seg><seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_001-3a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#wilke" modified="2026-10-21T22:00:34.626+09:00">and enlisted Hán, creating a Vertical Alliance;</seg><seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_001-3a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#wilke" modified="2026-10-21T22:00:51.739+09:00">they are about to face westwards and oppose Qin resolutely.</seg><seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_001-3a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#wilke" modified="2026-10-21T22:01:03.627+09:00">I take the liberty of laughing at them!</seg><seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_001-3a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#wilke" modified="2026-10-21T22:01:16.635+09:00">In the world there are three strategies that lead to ruin,</seg><seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_001-3a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#wilke" modified="2026-10-21T22:01:24.431+09:00">and the world has all three of them.</seg><seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_001-3a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#wilke" modified="2026-10-21T22:01:53.118+09:00">This must apply to the present situation.</seg><seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_001-4a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#wilke" modified="2026-10-21T22:02:05.027+09:00">I, your subject, have heard:</seg><seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_001-4a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#wilke" modified="2026-10-21T22:02:27.368+09:00">"One who attacks the orderly by means of chaos is doomed to be ruined,</seg><seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_001-4a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#wilke" modified="2026-10-21T22:03:06.563+09:00">one who attacks the correct by means of the deviant is doomed to be ruined,</seg><seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_001-4a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#wilke" modified="2026-10-21T22:03:25.767+09:00">and one who attacks the compliant by means of the obstinate is doomed to be ruined."</seg></p></div></body></text></TEI>